me players  get to explore these realms and uncover  mysteries and do things but they also  get to control what realms they go to  thanks to these things called realm  cards because we've built up this really  awesome procedural realm generation  system then players get to play these  cards and control what's on the other  side of portals so they can set the  biome like swamp forest or desert they  can then control other aspects of it and  they have to collect and craft these  realm cards over time share them with  friends do things like that and that  gives them a lot more agency and a lot  more decision making over what they're  going to play and what experience is  going to go all but this really cool fun  a little bit of story through all of it  too i was going to say there was a lot  to unpack there so i want to kick off  with you know you mentioned it's your  own ip um you've got the story threads  bringing you along are you talking like  are you going to give us any little  breadcrumbs about what that could entail  right now like who who am i playing at  yeah that's a good question so you play  as a realm walker and and at the start  of our game um you have gone through a  portal an effort to escape a catastrophe  uh in earth trying to get to the magical  city of nightingale because you figure  that'll be safe there but unfortunately  the portal network has malfunctioned and  you find yourself lost in these in these  deep realms far far away and so the um  the character in our in our trailer  there he is the first to see you and he  says well you're going to need to  survive out here and find a way back to  nightingale at some point so the long  adventure of our game is the realm  walkers finding their way back to  nightingale and all the adventures  they'll have along the way perfect and  so it's not just an adventure that i can  have by myself i can get my friends in  um how how is the multiplayer part of it  is it you know if i'm if i have a  character and