al crafting games offered a  lot of that this notion that you can  construct things and express yourself  creatively you can create gear for  yourselves create buildings for  yourselves and and that just really  really resonated with us early on so a  lot of those mechanics have been in  since the early days of the game and  since becoming inflection studios we  really decided that we would double down  on that and invest in that more fully  and try to bring that experience uh to  the forefront and i was gonna say  another part of it is you kind of have  the showing off part of things where you  know you you meet up with someone you're  like how did you get that yeah exactly  right this notion of of uh acquiring  things and of crafting it yourself and  putting all of that energy and passion  into it and making it just just perfect  for you right the game surrounding  crafting games do such such good things  with that and you get to do all that  knight and kill yeah and so and  nightingale as well i think the thing  that is interesting to me is like you  know valheim you've got and i bring that  up because i played a lot of it with my  friends it's like you have the the sort  of nordic fantasy kind of setting but  then that's the setting right but with  realm cards and in nightingale you have  all of these options for for you as a  developer how  i mean you want to obviously give the  team free reign to experiment and stuff  but how do you also bring that in  oh yeah well i'm lucky to work with a  lot of very talented developers who uh  have some experience in this and who are  pretty good at uh at managing themselves  and doing that um and so i trust them  and work with them and they they provoke  me to come up with things and make sure  that the studio is giving them what they  need to to go off and try these things  um but you know a lot of it's just come  together in the past you know three plus  years of working on this game you know  this notion that we have a 